Package: g-unity7-l10n
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: G Unity⁷ desktop translations missing from Ubuntu
 Translations from the gentoo-unity7 overlay that no Ubuntu package or
 language pack installs: Activity Log Manager, Startup Applications
 (unity-session-properties), the appearance and notifications indicators,
 the MATE Screenshot quicklist, the Dash session shortcuts and the Unity Help
 launcher.
